      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1355794900,
      "text": "Cardiocrinum giganteum, the giant Himalayan lily, is the largest species of any of the lily plants, growing up to 3.5 metres high. It is found in the Himalayas, China and Myanmar (Burma)."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Cardiocrinum giganteum",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cardiocrinum_giganteum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 120477266,
      "text": "Cardiocrinum giganteum, es la especie más grande de plantas de lirio. Puede crecer hasta los 3,5 metros de altura. Se encuentra en el Himalaya."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Cardiocrinum giganteum",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cardiocrinum_giganteum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 229466077,
      "text": "Cardiocrinum giganteum , le Lis géant de l'Himalaya, est la plus grande espèce de \"Lis\" ,poussant jusqu'à 3.5 mètres de haut. On le trouve dans l'Himalaya, en Chine et en Birmanie (Myanmar)."
    }
